This SDK supports the 50-task cached joint-position evaluation protocol.
Model training code, demonstration datasets and robot/object/texture assets
are not included. Obtain simulator assets from their official source.

This evaluation subset removes expert demonstration rollouts, data conversion
and unused CuRobo planning. Joint-position startup and gripper interpolation
are provided directly by the SDK. Scene creation, observation, action stepping,
success predicates and rendering parameters retain the evaluated behavior.
